<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading2'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `1.1 Installation'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Install the application before continuing. '>
 >
 <ParaLine
  <String `After installation, restart the service.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading3'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `1.1.1 System Requirements'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Ruby 3.3 or newer is recommended. '>
  <String `A PostgreSQL database is also required.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading3'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `1.1.2 Configuration'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Open the configuration file. '>
  <String `Set the database URL. '>
  <String `Then restart the application.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading2'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `1.2 Usage'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `The application can be started from the command line.'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Run the command \`bundle exec rails server\`. '>
  <String `The server should then be available locally.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading1'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `2 Advanced Features'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Advanced features are optional. '>
  <String `They can be enabled individually.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading2'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `2.1 Importing Documents'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `DOCX, XLSX, TMX, MIF, TXT, HTML, CSV, and XML files can be imported.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Heading3'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `2.1.1 Sentence Segmentation'>
 >
> # end of Para

<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `This paragraph has three sentences. '>
  <String `The Segment importer receives the whole paragraph. '>
  <String `PragmaticSegmenter can later create three Fragments.'>
 >
> # end of Para


<Para
 <PgfTag `Body'>
 <ParaLine
  <String `Special characters should also survive parsing: apostrophe \', backtick \`, and backslash \\.'>
 >
> # end of Para


